+# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
+
+#-------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# drawElements Quality Program utilities
+# --------------------------------------
+#
+# Copyright 2015 The Android Open Source Project
+#
+# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License");
